  "why": "behavioural spec 'verify': 'source' is { kind: 'inline', contracts: <each file's text as read, in the order given> }, parsing none of them (ADR 0063), so a number a parser would respell (10.0) and the file's layout reach the engine as written; poll 'until an event carrying last: true arrives'; 'verified' returns the result; the engine is ended however 'verify' ends.",
